1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Hi! We’re team Nabeghlavi. Our challenge: Build a Junior Astronaut Mission Trainer, so kids can feel real mission trade-offs.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Outpost 30: keep a Mars base alive for 30 sols. Every choice costs something, and the space weather is real.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Each sol replays real NASA data. On 18 January 2026, NASA DONKI logged an X1.9 solar flare and a particle storm.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Storm shelter costs 8 kWh and a card tomorrow, but cuts the storm’s hit by 70%. No choice is free.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Kids aged 7 to 12 learn how air, power and radiation shielding trade off, using 13 NASA and CSA datasets.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Free in any browser, offline, no account: a classroom-ready mission trainer. Scan the code to play!
